# Frontend rules

## Structure

- Pages and sections live in `src/App.js` (monolith)
- shadcn primitives: `src/components/ui/`
- `@/` alias → `src/` (CRACO webpack)
- API base: `process.env.REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL` + `/api`

## Patterns

```jsx
// Class merging
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";

// Toasts
import { toast } from "sonner";

// Motion sections — match existing AnimatedSection / fadeInUp variants
```

## UI checklist for new work

- Match dark theme and cyan/violet accents
- Use existing shadcn components before adding deps
- Framer Motion for scroll reveals; avoid jarring animation
- Responsive: mobile-first Tailwind (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`)
- `data-testid="kebab-case-name"` on buttons, links, inputs, selects

## Avoid

- Introducing TypeScript files into this CRA setup
- Light theme unless explicitly requested
- New global state libraries (keep local `useState` / hooks)
- Breaking `@emergentbase/visual-edits` CRACO wrapper in dev
